<para>This is provided to NCP target applications for processing commands received from NCP transport. This function is a synonym for a generic BGAPI function <ref refid="group__sl__bgapi__functions_1gac7b30151a238436c59e93a76aedbee0c" kindref="member">sl_bgapi_get_command_response</ref>. </para>
